# Proft, Sinister Mastermind: "You can't cast this spell unless there are seven or more cards in your graveyard." Cast from the
# graveyard (Yawgmoth's Will), Proft is itself one of the cards there while it is being cast, and the ruling asks for seven OTHER
# cards. Turn 1: Town Greeter mills Proft and three Guerrilla Gorillas; Black Lotus and two Dark Rituals (a chain of black mana)
# go to the graveyard too: seven cards, Proft and six others. Yawgmoth's Will lets Bot1 cast from the graveyard, and Proft is
# refused. The positive control is proft-sinister-mastermind-from-the-graveyard-with-seven-other-cards-is-cast, which has one
# more card there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Town Greeter
Black Lotus
Dark Ritual
Dark Ritual
Mox Jet
Yawgmoth's Will
Proft, Sinister Mastermind
Guerrilla Gorilla
Guerrilla Gorilla
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Town Greeter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yawgmoth's Will.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 7
! Bot1.Graveyard.Proft, Sinister Mastermind.Cast
